# German translation for wp-mobile-de-sync.
#
# The source language of the plugin is English; this file is the German
# shipping translation. One string is not a translation at all: the
# consumption disclaimer on the vehicle detail page is prescribed verbatim
# by the Pkw-EnVKV, so it carries the statutory wording.
#
# After editing, rebuild the binary catalogue:
#
#   php bin/po2mo.php languages/wp-mobile-de-sync-de_DE.po
#
